    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        400,
        820
      ],
      "size": [
        700,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Hi3D models (download them yourself)\n\n| File | Folder |\n| --- | --- |\n| Hi3D `transformer_512/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/diffusion_models/hi3d/transformer_512/` |\n| Hi3D `transformer_1024/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/diffusion_models/hi3d/transformer_1024/` |\n| Hi3D `vae/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/vae/hi3d/` |\n| DINOv2-large `model.safetensors` (facebook/dinov2-large) | `models/clip_vision/dinov2-large/` |\n| CLIP ViT-L/14 `model.safetensors` (openai/clip-vit-large-patch14) | `models/clip_vision/clip-vit-large-patch14/` |\n\nHi3D files: https://huggingface.co/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0 (Hi3D Open License 1.0).\nAny folder and file name works; pick the files in the loaders.\n\n**Resolution**: 512 = 1 pass, 1024 = 2 passes (default), 1536 = 3 passes (data-center GPUs).\nUse fp8 weight_dtype on the transformer loaders to save VRAM.\n\nUpload your coarse mesh in **Load 3D (Advanced)** (GLB/OBJ/STL). It must be the same object as the image."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Hi3D models (download them yourself)\n\n| File | Folder |\n| --- | --- |\n| Hi3D `transformer_512/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/diffusion_models/hi3d/transformer_512/` |\n| Hi3D `transformer_1024/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/diffusion_models/hi3d/transformer_1024/` |\n| Hi3D `vae/model.safetensors` + `config.json` | `models/vae/hi3d/` |\n| DINOv2-large `model.safetensors` (facebook/dinov2-large) | `models/clip_vision/dinov2-large/` |\n| CLIP ViT-L/14 `model.safetensors` (openai/clip-vit-large-patch14) | `models/clip_vision/clip-vit-large-patch14/` |\n\nHi3D files: https://huggingface.co/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0 (Hi3D Open License 1.0).\nAny folder and file name works; pick the files in the loaders.\n\n**Resolution**: 512 = 1 pass, 1024 = 2 passes (default), 1536 = 3 passes (data-center GPUs).\nUse fp8 weight_dtype on the transformer loaders to save VRAM.\n\nUpload your coarse mesh in **Load 3D (Advanced)** (GLB/OBJ/STL). It must be the same object as the image."
      },
